OL,3,GNEWSACalls for mill site to be secured
OL,4,Aafter third fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group and fire chiefs have
OL,7,Fcalled for more security at a historic
OL,8,Fmill after it was ravaged by a blaze
OL,9,Ffor the third time this year.
OL,11,FFlames engulfed Dalton Mills in
OL,12,FKeighley on Saturday night, prompting
OL,13,Fthe evacuation of nearby homes.
OL,15,FKeighley Civic Society said the
OL,16,Fincident was "distressing" for the
OL,17,Fownerless old textile mill's neighbours
OL,18,Fand said the Crown Estate, which is
OL,19,Fresponsible for the building, was
OL,20,F"dragging its feet" over putting
OL,21,Feffective security measures in place.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
